    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's no actual weight to anything. like, if life has no inherent meaning or goal, then there's no real difference between staying or leaving. it's just two different ways to exist, and one just... ends the noise. it feels like a neutral calculation, you know?",
